42662::$$$message_0345_0000_0000$$$::"Woo-hoo![lr]::
42663::$$$message_0345_0000_0001$$$::Found my next mark!"::
42664::$$$message_0345_0000_0002$$$::"Sh-[wvs][wait canskip=0 time=200][hfchance layer=0][say storage=HSIN3_RIN_0020 _name=å‡›]Shinji!? Where'd you come from? [lr]::
42665::$$$message_0345_0000_0003$$$::I'm busy patrolling town right now. Can you save the small talk for later?"::
42666::$$$message_0345_0000_0004$$$::"Well, that doesn't sound very safe. What's going on, Tohsaka? Something happen on the streets?"::
42667::$$$message_0345_0000_0005$$$::"I'm not sure, either.[lr]::
42668::$$$message_0345_0000_0006$$$::...The clues point to someone abducting girls at random, though."::
42669::$$$message_0345_0000_0007$$$::"Hahaha, that just means there's a [hfchance layer=1]gentleman on the loose, Tohsaka!"::
42670::$$$message_0345_0000_0008$$$::"Never mind that. Why don't we go to a hot spring together?"::
42671::$$$message_0345_0001_0000$$$::"I've been randomly asking girls, but it's pretty much been a bust."::
42673::$$$message_0345_0001_0002$$$::"It's you!!!" êL5